# sweep: --bare
# A paper longer than the reader fetches arrives cut short. Keep for offline
# on it must say it was not kept rather than open the paper and do nothing.
wait-for Preprints
tap Search arXiv
wait-for Type here
type swarmevolve
tap Search
wait-idle 20000
wait-for SwarmEvolve: Latent Agent Swarms
tap SwarmEvolve: Latent Agent Swarms
wait-idle
tap Keep for offline
wait-idle 30000
wait 3000
wait-for This paper is too long to keep for offline reading.
expect Keep for offline
clean
shot keep-long
